Here is the commit message:
bugfix for 3661e14674124de2026216682372d9b99ae0fe28

Quantifiers are no Application terms any more.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by treating quantifiers as application terms in the Z3 solver, which led to incorrect behavior when checking the type of terms. This misclassification resulted in failures in methods that expected only application terms, causing the solver to malfunction when handling quantified formulas.

Here is the patch:

   @Override
